/**
 * The usage notes in Polish.
 *
 * Keyed by the English note exactly as the card carries it. A note missing
 * from here shows its English, so this file is filled in batches without any
 * card ever going blank — see usageNotes.ts for how it is loaded and why it
 * is not part of the interface tables.
 *
 * Fourteen thousand notes exist. This holds the ones translated so far, and
 * check-usage-notes prints how far along each language is on every build.
 */
